 ## Exit codes

 | Code | Meaning |
 |---|---|
-| 0  | All cases pass (or warn-only mode hides regression) |
-| 12 | Regression detected AND harness promoted to blocking |
-| 13 | Harness/scorer error (NOT a skill regression) |
+| 0  | All cases pass, or explicit `EVAL_WARN_ONLY=1` allows failed assertions |
+| 12 | Failed assertions, including when no baseline exists |
+| 13 | Harness/scorer error in any attempt; never suppressed by warning mode |

